# The 10% that pay a copy, recorded with the claim that can retire it
# (panel 058 condition 5, ratified 2026-08-15).
#
# `putenv(char *string)` does not write through its argument — it **retains** it,
# and POSIX says the string becomes part of the environment. That is why the
# diagnostic says *"C does not promise to leave it alone"* and not *"C would write
# through it"*: the first wording was measured wrong on `free`, which deallocates,
# and `putenv` is the second witness. The header declares a permission; only the
# header knows which one is exercised. Heroes refuses the `cstr` spelling either
# way, and this file records what that costs rather than claiming it costs nothing.
#
# THE MEASURED CLAIM, and it is falsifiable: of 186 plain `char *` parameters
# across 17 headers, **159 (85%) genuinely write** and only **18 (10%)** are the
# legacy const-incorrect class that pays a copy it does not need — ncurses'
# five terminfo entry points, seven in OpenSSL, `cget*`, `rl_expand_prompt`.
# The refusal is worth its cost at that ratio.
#
# WHAT RETIRES IT: measure the same ratio on a header a real Heroes program
# binds. Above roughly 25% read-only, the refusal is costing more than it buys
# and panel 058's resolution reopens on its own terms. Below, it stands.
#
# The repair is never "add `const`" — that is the header's to choose, not this
# program's. It is `ptr` with a buffer C owns.
#
# **THE WITNESS IS `strtok` AND NOT `putenv`, and the swap is a fixed defect**
# (2026-08-15). `putenv` was the case's only line, and `putenv` is POSIX: the MSVC
# CRT spells it `_putenv` and takes `const char *`, so on the Windows leg this
# refusal fired **nowhere** — and since this was the diagnostic's only case in the
# corpus, `ffi_writable_parameter` had zero coverage on a third of CI without
# anything going red about *that*. A check with no witness is worse than a check
# that fails.
#
# `strtok(char *s1, const char *s2)` is **C11 §7.24.5.8** — the standard mandates
# the unqualified `char *`, so every conforming implementation declares it that
# way and the refusal cannot go quiet on a platform. That is the property being
# bought, and it is deliberately independent of what any one libc does: the repair
# does not rest on a claim about MSVC, it rests on the standard.
#
# `putenv` stays in the paragraphs above because it is what panel 058 measured and
# why the message says *"does not promise to leave it alone"* rather than *"would
# write through it"*. The record keeps the witness that taught the lesson; the test
# uses the one that fires everywhere.

extern "string.h"
    function strtok(s1: cstr, s2: cstr) -> cstr   #~ ffi_writable_parameter

function main()
    print(strtok(s1: "a,b".cstr(), s2: ",".cstr()) == nullptr)
